    {
      "id": "3.27.7",
      "label": "3.27.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "त्रिशिराः तु रथेन एव वाजि युक्तेन भास्वता |\nअभ्यद्रवत् रणे रामम् त्रि शृंग इव पर्वतः",
      "iast": "triśirāḥ tu rathena eva vāji yuk{}tena bhāsvatā |\nabhyadravat raṇe rāmam tri śṛṃga iva parvataḥ",
      "translation": "Trishira with a lustrous chariot that is yoked with equally lustrous horses hurried towards Rama in that war, like a tri-peaked mountain, for they say, he is a tri-headed demon.",
