      "translation": "On seeing the oncoming of that demon Trishira, Raghava welcomed him by speedily winnowing smarting arrows from his bow.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "raaghavaH",
          "iast": "rāghavaḥ",
          "devanagari": "राघवः",
          "meaning": "Raghava",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 5
        },
        {
