      "label": "3.27.11",
      "numbers": [
        11
      ],
      "devanagari": "ततः त्रिशिरसा बाणैः ललाटे ताडितः त्रिभिः |\nअमर्षी कुपितो रामः संरब्धम् इदम् अब्रवीत्",
      "iast": "tataḥ triśirasā bāṇaiḥ lalāṭe tāḍitaḥ tribhiḥ |\namarṣī kupito rāmaḥ saṃrabdham idam abravīt",
      "translation": "Later when Trishira smote on the forehead of highly enraged Rama with three arrows, Rama's ire is intensified and he franticly said this to that demon.",
