      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "मम अपि प्रतिगृह्णीष्व शरान् चाप गुण च्युतान् |\nएवम् उक्त्वा सुसंरब्धः शरान् आशीविष उपमान्\nत्रिशिरो वक्षसि क्रुद्धो निजघान चतुर् दश |",
      "iast": "mama api pratigṛhṇīṣ.hva śarān cāpa guṇa cyutān |\nevam uk{}tvā susaṃrabdhaḥ śarān āśīviṣa upamān\ntriśiro vakṣasi kruddho nijaghāna catur daśa |",
      "translation": "\"Now you accept arrows plunging from the string of my bow...\" saying thus, that infuriated Rama with his alacritous swiftness hit the chest of Trishira with fourteen arrows similar to venomous snakes.",
