    {
      "id": "3.27.16",
      "label": "3.27.16",
      "numbers": [
        16
      ],
      "devanagari": "ततो हत रथात् तस्मात् उत्पतंतम् निशाचरम्\nचिच्छ्हेद रामः तम् बाणैः हृदये सो अभवत् जडः |",
      "iast": "tato hata rathāt tasmāt utpataṃtam niśācaram\ncicchheda rāmaḥ tam bāṇaiḥ hṛdaye so abhavat jaḍaḥ |",
      "translation": "When that nightwalker is vaulting from that smashed chariot Rama with his arrows tore his chest to shreds and he that Trishira became inert.",
