      "label": "3.27.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "सायकैः च अप्रमेय आत्मा सामर्षः तस्य रक्षसः\nशिरांसि अपातयत् त्रीणि वेगवद्भिः त्रिभिः शतैः |",
      "iast": "sāyakaiḥ ca aprameya ātmā sāmarṣaḥ tasya rakṣasaḥ\nśirāṃsi apātayat trīṇi vegavadbhiḥ tribhiḥ śataiḥ |",
      "translation": "And with three sharp and rapid arrows, and even with his own exasperation, Rama of inestimable aptitude rolled the three heads that demon.",
